
=== FamilyPortraitN2 ===

A flimsy family portrait of the Crowells hangs precariously on the wall.

You notice a lanky arm around Mildred’s shoulder who you assume to be her husband Hank.

Mildred's hand sits quietly atop a young boy’s head, rustling his brown hair.

The boy stands there with nearly perfect posture as if he’s trying to impress someone.

They look happy.

-> END
